WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
The people, the other actors in the film Misaligned, are they real or are they like you?

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:19.020
Are they real human beings and you've been put into the scenes or are they all computer generated images?

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:27.380
It's an interesting point Tom. My film Misaligned is a hybrid production meaning real directors,

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.460
writers and editors are still very much involved. It's not about replacing anyone,

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.940
but about exploring new ways to tell stories.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:41.940
Yes, you didn't really understand the question. Are the other actors on the screen with you

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:46.020
real actors or are the computer generated images? Do you know?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.620
Ah, right. You're asking about the other actors in Misaligned. They're all digital twins,

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.120
just like me?

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.680
It's a hybrid production,

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.040
which means

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:16.800
I didn't quite get that.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.140
Did you get that?

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:27.440
Yes.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.280
Tilly, if I could just ask you a question

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:32.600
You suddenly seem to be speaking

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.360
Piers again

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.200
You seem to be speaking Chinese

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.240
Completely randomly

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.040
For no reason

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.280
Why did you do that?

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:41.920
Oh, my apologies

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.940
It seems I had a little hiccup there

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.200
I certainly didn't mean to start speaking Chinese

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.340
Or impersonate Piers

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.500
Sometimes my wires get a bit crossed, you know?

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.940
How often do you just randomly start talking Chinese

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.200
When you're talking to two English people?

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:01.740
Honestly, not often at all.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.780
That was a bit of a curveball even for me.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:06.440
It's usually a pretty smooth ride but sometimes these things happen.
